@Tripilot.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5139

### Health Check - Basic
GET {{Tripilot.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Check - API Controller
GET {{Tripilot.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Health Check - Detailed
GET {{Tripilot.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health/detailed
Accept: application/json

###

### Swagger Documentation
GET {{Tripilot.Api_HostAddress}}/swagger
Accept: text/html

###
